{"title":"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/b/96bc438e15ae11d18766135ce1f8e4518851c6c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{2} - 2^{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/0/eb02fc72c5ffdbaeed330fa86f8887d94264b24d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 4 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 0 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/e/d0e9136809f832318fdd66a5180d0e20660e072b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{2} = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/f/6ffbc99e2825b6f4458b370bae99157e55a79e65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{3} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />, so the difference between the two is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/8/a88ca637666cc0f26b0cf6598a0c2d95d335ce04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16 - 8 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"132\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gau